  "[color=#f7c35a][b]Villagers[/b][/color]\nComplete all twelve tasks AND find both Nenek Kebayan to win.\nApproach the gong and press Interact to call a meeting.\nDiscuss for 45 seconds, then vote or Skip within 20 seconds.\n\n[color=#f7c35a][b]Sleep Spell[/b][/color]\nHuman villagers sleep until the match ends. They can move around the map but cannot chat, vote, or do tasks.\n\n[color=#f7c35a][b]Fog & Door Lock[/b][/color]\nFog covers nearby surroundings for 20 seconds. Doors lock for 10 seconds. Both share a two-minute recharge.\n\n[color=#f7c35a][b]Controls[/b][/color]\nUse WASD, arrow keys, or the touch pad. Press E near a task or gong.": "[color=#f7c35a][b]Orang Kampung[/b][/color]\nSelesaikan semua dua belas tugas DAN cari kedua-dua Nenek Kebayan untuk menang.\nDekati gong dan tekan Interaksi untuk memanggil mesyuarat.\nBincang selama 45 saat, kemudian undi atau Langkau dalam masa 20 saat.\n\n[color=#f7c35a][b]Mantera Tidur[/b][/color]\nOrang Kampung manusia tidur sehingga perlawanan tamat. Mereka boleh bergerak tetapi tidak boleh berbual, mengundi atau melakukan tugas.\n\n[color=#f7c35a][b]Kabus & Kunci Pintu[/b][/color]\nKabus menyelubungi kawasan sekitar selama 20 saat. Pintu dikunci selama 10 saat. Kedua-duanya berkongsi masa cas semula dua minit.\n\n[color=#f7c35a][b]Kawalan[/b][/color]\nGunakan WASD, kekunci anak panah atau pad sentuh. Tekan E berhampiran tugas atau gong.",
  "HMS Core help": "Bantuan HMS Core",
  "Huawei ID needs HMS Core. Install or update HMS Core using Huawei AppGallery, then reopen the game. Tap HMS Core help for instructions.": "Huawei ID memerlukan HMS Core. Pasang atau kemas kini HMS Core melalui Huawei AppGallery, kemudian buka semula game. Tekan Bantuan HMS Core untuk panduan.",
  "Huawei sign-in timed out. Check HMS Core and your connection, then try again.": "Log masuk Huawei mengambil masa terlalu lama. Semak HMS Core dan sambungan internet, kemudian cuba lagi.",
  "Keep the game open. Empty slots fill with bots after 2 minutes.\nAn internet connection is required on every device.": "Biarkan game terbuka. Bot mengisi ruang kosong selepas 2 minit.\nSetiap peranti memerlukan sambungan internet.",
  "Share the room code with your friends.\nWorks on the same or different networks.\n\n1–10 players · bots join after 2 minutes": "Kongsi kod bilik dengan rakan anda.\nBoleh digunakan pada rangkaian sama atau berbeza.\n\n1–10 pemain · bot menyertai selepas 2 minit",
  "Enter the host's code. Works on the same or different networks.\nAn internet connection is required.": "Masukkan kod hos. Boleh digunakan pada rangkaian sama atau berbeza.\nSambungan internet diperlukan.",
  "Cannot reach the online server. Check your internet connection and try again. The server may be restarting.": "Pelayan dalam talian tidak dapat dihubungi. Semak internet dan cuba lagi. Pelayan mungkin sedang dimulakan semula.",
  "Cannot start the search. Check your internet and try again.": "Carian tidak dapat dimulakan. Semak internet dan cuba lagi.",
  "Cannot open a Wi-Fi room. Another host may already be open on this device; close that room or join it instead.": "Bilik Wi-Fi tidak dapat dibuka. Hos lain mungkin aktif pada peranti ini; tutup bilik itu atau sertai bilik tersebut.",
  "Cannot reach the host. Use the same Wi-Fi, keep the host's game open, and allow the game on Private networks if Windows asks.": "Hos tidak dapat dihubungi. Gunakan Wi-Fi yang sama, biarkan game hos terbuka dan benarkan rangkaian Peribadi jika diminta oleh Windows.",
  "Allow the game on Private networks if Windows asks.\nKeep the host's game open. Empty slots fill with bots after 2 minutes.": "Benarkan game pada rangkaian Peribadi jika diminta oleh Windows.\nBiarkan game hos terbuka. Bot mengisi ruang kosong selepas 2 minit.",
  "Room not found on this Wi-Fi. Check the code and keep the host's game open. Guest networks may block nearby devices.": "Bilik tidak ditemui pada Wi-Fi ini. Semak kod dan biarkan game hos terbuka. Rangkaian tetamu mungkin menyekat peranti berdekatan.",
  "The host was found but could not be reached. Keep its game open and try again.": "Hos ditemui tetapi tidak dapat dihubungi. Biarkan gamenya terbuka dan cuba lagi.",
  "Local room not found. On university/shared Wi-Fi, select Internet on both devices and create a new room.": "Bilik setempat tidak ditemui. Pada Wi-Fi universiti atau Wi-Fi dikongsi, pilih Internet pada kedua-dua peranti dan cipta bilik baharu.",
  "More than one host has this code. Ask the host to create a new room.": "Lebih daripada satu hos menggunakan kod ini. Minta hos mencipta bilik baharu.",
  "The sign-in service returned an incomplete response. Please try again.": "Perkhidmatan log masuk memberikan respons tidak lengkap. Sila cuba lagi.",
  "Google sign-in could not be verified. Please try again.": "Log masuk Google tidak dapat disahkan. Sila cuba lagi.",
